{"format":"helia-content","version":1,"id":"day-convolution","title":{"Inline":[{"Text":"Day Convolution"}]},"title_text":"Day Convolution","kind":"definition","taxon":null,"url":"day-convolution.html","content":{"Block":[{"Group":{"role":"env","attrs":[["entry","day-convolution"],["kind","definition"],["label","Definition"],["numbered","true"]],"body":{"Block":[{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Let "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(V)"}},{"Text":" be a symmetric monoidal closed category that is complete and cocomplete. Let "},{"Math":{"src":"(cal(C), times.o_cal(C), I)"}},{"Text":" be a small monoidal "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(V)"}},{"Text":"-enriched "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"category","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"category"}]}},{"Text":". The "},{"Emph":[{"Text":"Day convolution"}]},{"Text":" of "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(V)"}},{"Text":"-enriched presheaves "},{"Math":{"src":"A, B : cal(C)^\"op\" -> cal(V)"}},{"Text":" is the enriched presheaf"}]},{"Math":{"src":"(A times.o_\"Day\" B) thin c = integral^(u, v) cal(C)(c, u times.o_cal(C) v) times.o_cal(V) A u times.o_cal(V) B v ,"}},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"with unit the representable "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)(-, I)"}},{"Text":"."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Day convolution makes the enriched presheaf category "},{"Math":{"src":"[cal(C)^\"op\", cal(V)]"}},{"Text":" a monoidal category, symmetric when "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":" is "},{"Cite":{"key":"day1970construction","supplement":null,"rendered":"[1]"}},{"Text":". It is moreover "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"day-closed-structure","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"closed"}]}},{"Text":"."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Under the enriched Yoneda embedding the convolution of representables is representable, "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)(-, x) times.o_\"Day\" cal(C)(-, y) ≅ cal(C)(-, x times.o_cal(C) y)"}},{"Text":", so Day convolution is the cocontinuous extension of the tensor of "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":"."}]},{"Heading":{"level":2,"body":[{"Text":"As a Kan Extension"}],"numbering":null,"outlined":true}},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Equivalently, "},{"Math":{"src":"A times.o_\"Day\" B"}},{"Text":" is the left Kan extension of "},{"Math":{"src":"(u, v) |-> A u times.o_cal(V) B v"}},{"Text":" along "},{"Math":{"src":"times.o_cal(C)^\"op\" : cal(C)^\"op\" ×\ncal(C)^\"op\" -> cal(C)^\"op\""}},{"Text":"."}]},{"Heading":{"level":2,"body":[{"Text":"In "},{"Math":{"src":"bold(\"Set\")"}}],"numbering":null,"outlined":true}},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"When "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(V) = bold(\"Set\")"}},{"Text":", we recover the ordinary Day convolution of presheaves "},{"Math":{"src":"A, B : cal(C)^\"op\" -> bold(\"Set\")"}},{"Text":", where the formula simplifies to:"}]},{"Math":{"src":"(A times.o_\"Day\" B) thin c = integral^(u, v) cal(C)[c, u times.o_cal(C) v] × A u × B v ."}}]}}}]}}
